# One line ending everywhere: the Windows checkouts drifted into a CRLF/LF mix,
# which polls W293 (blank line contains whitespace) in flake8 and makes diffs
# look like whole-file rewrites. Normalize on checkin, LF in the working tree.
*.py text eol=lf
*.pyi text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
